  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-terminal art direction, disciplined cyan/red/green semantics, and a clear desktop comparison hierarchy. Tablet remains coherent but becomes excessively tall. Mobile compresses dense rows, metadata, and evidence copy into very small type, making the screen feel like a scaled-down desktop table rather than a deliberately composed mobile view. The mobile/tablet header also presents visibly clipped navigation and weaker brand presence.",
